Yes, you can retrieve the Product name in the first query without using LoadWith by using a join or select new in your LINQ query. Here's how you can do it:

Method 1: Using Join

```
var orders = from o in context.Orders
             join p in context.Products on o.ProductID equals p.ProductID 
             select new 
             {
                OrderID = o.OrderID, 
                ProductName = p.ProductName
                // other fields you need 
             };
